{"id":"wb-7-1200","name":"临沣寨","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"临沣寨","text":"临沣寨，又称红石寨，位于中国河南省平顶山市郏县堂街镇临沣寨村，是由清代红石寨墙围合的村寨，寨内保存明清时期的民居。寨墙、护寨河和住宅院落共同构成其建筑格局，兼具居住、防御和防洪功能。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%B4%E6%B2%A3%E5%AF%A8","revisionId":95081200,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95081200","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/97e0572040d742de91e797a4.jpg","title":"临沣寨_-_panoramio.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%B4%E6%B2%A3%E5%AF%A8_-_panoramio.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/51/%E4%B8%B4%E6%B2%A3%E5%AF%A8_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Lanch","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"临沣寨","width":320,"height":240}}